CATEGORIES:kids\,Brooks Memorial Library
DESCRIPTION:It’s that time of year\, again! World Singing Day!* Come tog
 ether with friends and neighbors to raise your voices and raise your spiri
 ts by singing a wide variety of favorite songs.  Lyrics will be projected
  on a big screen by George Carvill\, so we will all know the words.  Live
  guitar accompaniment will be provided by Rich Grumbine.  All ages are en
 couraged to attend – the more\, the merrier! \n*Please note: this year\,
  the actual day is October 16th\, which falls during the Brattleboro Liter
 ary Fesitval.  Therefore\, Brooks will be celebrating and open on a rare 
 Friday night\, a week later\; and\, we do hope the more\, the merrier!\nSo
 urce: Brooks Memorial Library
END:VEVENT
