DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261031T120000
SUMMARY:Vermont People's Arms Embargo Teach-in
LOCATION:Meeting Room A – Community Meeting Room\, 224 Main Street\, Bra
 ttleboro\, VT\, 05301\, United States
URL:https://brookslibraryvt.org/event/vermont-peoples-arms-embargo-teach-i
 n/
CATEGORIES:kids\,Brooks Memorial Library
DESCRIPTION:As Israel’s genocide Palestine enters begins it’s fourth y
 ear\, the Vermont People’s Arms Embargo released an online tool mapping 
 the weapons industry in Vermont and its connection to the genocide. Join u
 s for a morning teach-in as we introduce this tool and connect with each o
 ther on paths ahead. We’ll explore what that industrial landscape and ti
 es to genocide look like\; what weapons\, tech\, and components are manufa
 ctured in Vermont\, and specifically Southern Vermont\; how this relates t
 o other struggles we face\; and how people in other locales have confronte
 d arms manufacturing in their areas. Plus there’ll be refreshments!\nSou
 rce: Brooks Memorial Library
END:VEVENT
