DESCRIPTION:Need basic tech help or to practice your technology skills?  
 We can help you at the library. \nHere is how it works: We will be offerin
 g one-to-one tech help with basic computer or mobile device questions.  T
 he appts will be for 30 min scheduled by a phone call to the library.  80
 2-365-7948.  The service will be offered the 2nd and 4th Thursday of the 
 month from 5:00 to 6:00 pm. \n(thanks to the Friends of the MFL for fundin
 g the project and Cameron Misnick for providing the service.)\nSource: Moo
 re Free Library
END:VEVENT
